OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith some bright spells at first.
OL,7,FClouding over later in the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight with showery rain spreading
OL,9,Fsouth for a time. Turning drier later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FChance of a light shower at
OL,12,Ffirst in the north. Otherwise dry and
OL,13,Frather cool with some bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells and variable cloud.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,17,Fdry although rather cloudy at times
OL,18,Fover the weekend. Dry with more in the
OL,19,Fway of sunshine on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
